INTERPRETATION
For each reflection shell cut rho, let

  B_rho = [[A_+, Delta Pi_rho], [0, A_-]].

The row from the plus root of B_rho^3-B_rho^2 was entrywise
nonnegative in every displayed case.  The stronger unshifted kernel

  f_4 B_rho^5-f_5 B_rho^4

is false, first by -8 at the displayed parameter and terminal-block
entry.  In contrast, the exact kernel needed by the minimum t=2
prefix,

  f_4 B_rho^6-f_5 B_rho^5,

had no negative entry in the displayed scan.  Its terminal block also
remained nonnegative after factoring it into the folded five-step
reserve and the smoothed unshifted terminal row.  The stronger claims
that the boundary correction, each individual crossing column, or each
adjacent column pair is nonnegative are all false at the displayed
negative controls.  The extra block step and cumulative shell reserve
are therefore essential.  The scan is bounded evidence for Targets
5A8H28R2--5A8H28R3, not their proof.

